 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Of course. See you.": "",
  "Morita's here in Kamurocho.\nBlowing the lid off Ayabe's casino.": "",
  "In that case, I better get going.": "",
  "In that case, I should be going.": "",
  "He's not gonna come here.": "",
  "Not like he'd come here.": "",
  "Well, better safe than sorry.": "",
  "Still, caution never hurt.": "",
  "Hm. If they're raiding the casino,\nKuroiwa's probably there, too.": "",
  "If they're raiding the casino,\nKuroiwa's probably there, too.": "",
  "Whaddya wanna do, Tak?": "",
  "What's the plan then, Tak?": "",
  "The chief prosecutor's made his move.": "",
  "Probably wouldn't hurt to stop by\nand say hello. We know all about him now.": "",
  "Probably wouldn't hurt to stop by and say hello.\nWe know all about him now.": "",
  "You sure this is a good idea?\nHe's not the kinda guy you mess around with.": "",
  "You sure about this?\nHe's not a guy you mess around with.": "",
  "Don't worry, we just wanna check in.": "",
  "We'll keep it nice and friendly.": "",
  "I'm Ayabe's lawyer. Let me through.": "",
  "I'm representing Ayabe.": "",
  "Sorry, no lawyers allowed yet!": "",
  "Huh? Sorry, I still can't let you through.": "",
  "Well done, but let him pass.\nI'll vouch for him personally.": "",
  "Good work. But you can let him in.\nI'll take responsibility.": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor?": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor...?": "",
  "Were you aware there was an underground casino\nhidden down here, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Perhaps you weren't aware, Yagami-san, but there's an\nunderground casino here. Hidden in the basement, it seems.": "",
  "Wow, I had no idea.": "",
  "Wow, the things you learn...": "",
  "Heh. Our friend Ayabe was really\nsomething, wasn't he?": "",
  "Our friend Ayabe was really something.": "",
  "Who would have thought he'd take bribes\nfrom an illicit underground casino?": "",
  "Who would have thought he'd take his bribes\nfrom an illicit underground casino?": "",
  "Not to mention selling confidential police intel\nto the criminal underbelly of this town.": "",
  "Not to mention, selling confidential police intel to\nthe criminal underbelly of this town.": "",
  "Shintani-sensei surely\nstumbled upon Ayabe's secret.": "",
  "It's fair to assume Shintani-sensei stumbled upon\nAyabe's secret.": "",
  "And so, Ayabe killed him to make sure the truth\nstayed hidden. Quickly, with a police-issued handgun.": "",
  "And so, Ayabe killed him to make sure the truth stayed hidden.\nQuickly, with a police-issued handgun.": "",
  "I see. That's the story\nthe prosecution is telling, huh?": "",
  "I see. So that's the story\nyou're going with.": "",
  "We can speak further\nonce we get inside.": "",
  "...Well. We can speak\nmore downstairs.": "",
  "I've learned a lot about you,\nChief Prosecutor.": "",
  "I've learned a lot about you,\nChief Prosecutor Morita.": "",
  "About the tragedy in your family\nten years ago.": "",
  "Ten years ago... there was a tragedy\nin your family.": "",
  "Then someone has betrayed me?": "",
  "So, someone has betrayed me?": "",
  "Someone you betrayed.\nSomeone who trusted you for years.": "",
  "Someone who you betrayed.\nSomeone who had trusted you for years.": "",
  "I have to say, it was strange seeing\nhow you behaved in Shono's lab.": "",
  "Back in Shono's lab, you made\na very strange choice. ": "",
  "A public prosecutor, the so-called defenders of justice...\nchose to protect AD-9 over the sanctity of the law.": "",
  "A public prosecutor defends justice.\nBut you chose to protect AD-9 over the sanctity of the law.": "",
  "I think it's time you dropped the act.": "",
  "I know everything, so drop the act.": "",
  "My mother, she... was afflicted with early onset\nAlzheimer's. The disease progressed quickly.": "",
  "My mother, she... she was afflicted with early onset Alzheimer's.\nThe disease progressed quickly.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So this is Morita's family...)</color>": "",
  "Not long after she started showing symptoms,\nshe couldn't even recognize my face.": "",
  "Whenever I went to visit her, I was greeted with\n\"nice to meet you\". As if she didn't know who I was.": "",
  "Soon every visit began with,\n\"Nice to meet you.\"": "",
  "Occasionally she'd yell at me.\nAccuse me of being a thief or a murderer.": "",
  "She'd call names. Accuse me of being a thief or a murderer.\nShrieking accusations as I left.": "",
  "Watching my mother's mind deteriorate...\nWell, it nearly broke me.": "",
  "Watching my mother's mind deteriorate...\nIt nearly broke me.": "",
  "And yet, my brother continued caring for her.\nHe was there when I couldn't be, all by himself.": "",
  "But all through her pain, my brother alone\ncontinued caring for her. For years.": "",
  "When we were young,\nhe and I had both dreamt of becoming lawyers.": "",
  "He and I had both dreamt\nof becoming lawyers.": "",
  "He devoted himself to his studies, far better\nthan I ever did. Practically worked himself to the bone.": "",
  "Day after day, he devoted himself to studying.\nFar more than I ever did.": "",
  "Yet ultimately,\nhe never managed to pass the bar.": "",
  "Yet ultimately, he never managed\nto pass the bar.": "",
  "I can only imagine how he felt\nwhen I passed on my first attempt.": "",
  "And when I passed on my first attempt...\nI can only imagine how he felt.": "",
  "And yet, he was happy for me.\nAlmost as if my success was his.": "",
  "But even so... he expressed nothing but joy\nfor my success.": "",
  "He was truly... A good man.": "",
  "He was... a truly kind person.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(His confidence is wavering...\nThis left a lot of scars.)</color>": "",
  "Please, go on.": "",
  "Go on, please.": "",
  "When we learned that my mother had Alzheimers,\nmy brother was devasted by the news. He took it hard.": "",
  "When we learned of my mother's illness,\nmy brother was genuinely concerned for her.": "",
  "I, on the other hand...\nwas filled with internal conflict.": "",
  "But I... I was filled with\ninternal conflict.": "",
  "I was torn between caring for my ailing mother\nand continuing my burgeoning career as a lawyer.": "",
  "I was torn between caring for my ailing mother,\nand continuing my burgeoning career as a lawyer.": "",
  "But my brother could sense how I felt...\nAnd then he said to me...": "",
  "My brother must have sensed it.\nThen he told me...": "",
  "Don't worry.\nLeave Mom to me.": "",
  "Leave Mom to me.": "",
  "Your success is all that matters.\nAs long as you make it, my dream comes true too.": "",
  "\"I want to see you succeed... Grasp the dream I couldn't.\nThat's all I need.\"": "",
  "And so, he continued caring for our mother for seven long years,\n24 hours a day. A woman who couldn't even recognize him as her own son.": "",
  "He looked after our mother for seven long years, 24 hours a day.\nA woman who couldn't even recognize her own son.": "",
  "Whereas I...\nRan further and further away.": "",
  "Whereas I... kept running.": "",
  "But somewhere deep down in my heart, I knew it couldn't\ncontinue that way. That someday he would break.": "",
  "But I knew in my heart that it couldn't last.\nThat someday he would break.": "",
  "And the regret you feel, that failure...\nIs what led you to AD-9.": "",
  "And your regrets about it...\nled you to abet AD-9.": "",
  "When was it?": "",
  "When'd you get involved?": "",
  "After Shintani-sensei's murder.": "",
  "Not long after, Vice Minister Ichinose\nsummoned me personally to fill me in on the details.": "",
  "At that point, Vice Minister Ichinose summoned me personally.\nHe filled me in on the details.": "",
  "He did? But why?": "",
  "Ichinose did? Personally?\nBut why?": "",
  "Ichinose-san predicted that the prosecutors' office\nwould discover the dark truth about AD-9 before long.": "",
  "Ichinose-san knew. Eventually the prosecutors\nwould discover the truth of AD-9.": "",
  "And upon looking into some family histories...\nHe discovered what happened to my mother.": "",
  "And upon looking into some family histories...\nhe discovered the case of my mother's Alzheimer's.": "",
  "When he realized the extent of it,\nhe knew I would be sympathetic to their cause.": "",
  "When Ichinose-san discovered the extent of the tragedy...\nhe knew I'd be sympathetic to their cause.": "",
  "His proposal was quite clear.": "",
  "His proposal was clear.": "",
  "AD-9 was a groundbreaking new drug, meant to save\ncountless suffering patients and families...": "",
  "AD-9 was a groundbreaking new drug.\nMeant to save countless suffering patients and families...": "",
  "But if it was to see the light of day...\nI would have to look the other way for a while.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(And that's how someone with\nthe best intentions gets led astray.)</color>": "",
  "Prosecutor Morita.\nHave you heard this saying before?": "",
  "You know, there's a saying\nthat's stuck with me...": "",
  "Fire tempers iron,\nand temptation steels the just.": "",
  "\"Fire tempers iron,\nand temptation steels the just.\"": "",
  "If someone told you they knew how to make\nmankind immortal at the sacrifice of a few...": "",
  "If someone offered you the secret\nto immortality, for a \"small\" sacrifice...": "",
  "You would've looked the other way\nno matter how many people had to die.": "",
  "You would've looked the other way.\nNo matter how many people had to die.": "",
  "I do feel guilt, I can't deny that.\nThat's the only reason I'm still here.": "",
  "I don't deny my guilt in this.\nThat's the only reason I've let you carry on.": "",
  "Shono has killed people to cover this up.\nEmi Terasawa died for it.": "",
  "Shono was so desperate to hide his experiments,\nhe murdered Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "What about her?\nDid she deserve that!?": "",
  "Meanwhile Shinpei Okubo was\nfalsely convicted, and sentenced to death.": "",
  "Under a false conviction, Shinpei Okubo\nwas sent to death row.": "",
  "He wakes up every day\nnot knowing if it's his last.": "",
  "For three years, he's been prepared to die\nfor a crime he didn't commit.": "",
  "What did he do to deserve that?": "",
  "What did he do to deserve that!?": "",
  "Hattori wrote this, huh?": "",
  "Crazy stuff.\nYou said Hattori wrote this?": "",
  "Yeah. Said he tried to get it out\njust in time for today's trial.": "",
  "Yup. Said he tried to get it out\nin time for the trial.": "",
  "Illegal Human Experiments Discovered in Kamurocho...\n\"Dementia Drug AD-9 the Focus\".": "",
  "\"Illegal Human Experiments Discovered in Kamurocho\"...\n\"Dementia Drug AD-9 the Focus\".": "",
  "These pictures...": "",
  "I took 'em when we broke\ninto Shono's lab.": "",
  "Yep, all mine. Took 'em when we\nbroke into Shono's lab.": "",
  "Heh, good shit.": "",
  "Yeesh. Don't think I'm ever gonna\nget used to seein' you in a suit.": "",
  "Back in the suit, huh...?\nI'll never get used to this.": "",
  "That's all you have to say to me?\nThis is kinda a big deal, remember?": "",
  "That's all you got?\nThis is kinda a big deal, remember?": "",
  "Are they gonna set Okubo free\nif you win this trial?": "",
  "So if you win this trial,\nOkubo walks free, huh?": "",
  "It's not guaranteed... but if not today, I'll make it\nhappen eventually. Even if it costs me my life.": "",
  "If not today, I'll still make it happen somehow.\nEven if it costs me my life.": "",
  "It's time.\nGive 'em hell in there.": "",
  "It's time. Give 'em hell in there.": "",
  "I will.\nMatsugane-san deserves justice.": "",
  "I will. For Matsugane-san.": "",
  "Good luck today, Yagami-san.\nI'll be taking notes.": "",
  "Good luck in there today, Yagami-san.\nI'll be taking notes.": "",
  "I dunno, this trial might not be\nthe most textbook case.": "",
  "I dunno. This trial might not be\nthe most textbook case.": "",
  "That's exactly why it'll be\nan educational experience.": "",
  "Well... that's exactly why\nit'll be educational.": "",
  "Defendant. Please state your name\nand date of birth for the record.": "",
  "Please state your name\nand date of birth for the record.": "",
  "Kazuya Ayabe.\nBorn on July 2nd, 1983.": "",
  "Kazuya Ayabe.\nDate of birth... July 2nd, 1983.": "",
  "And where are you currently residing?": "",
  "This is the first trial\nfor the murder of Masamichi Shintani.": "",
  "It's the first day of proceedings\nin the murder case of a Kamurocho lawyer.": "",
  "The defendant... A crooked cop\nby the name of Kazuya Ayabe.": "",
  "Masamichi Shintani's supposed killer...\nA crooked cop by the name of Kazuya Ayabe.": "",
  "The bullet found in Shintani's body bore\nthe rifling marks from Ayabe's gun.": "",
  "The bullet found in Shintani's body\nbore the rifling marks from Ayabe's gun.": "",
  "That's the most significant piece\nof evidence they have against him.": "",
  "That's the core of their case\nagainst him.": "",
  "But that was all a cover-up\nperpetrated by the Mole. Kuroiwa.": "",
  "But I know... the Mole did this.\nKuroiwa framed him for the whole thing.": "",
  "Ayabe is innocent.": "",
  "In other words,\nthis trial is little more than a farce.": "",
  "In other words, this trial is basically a farce.\nWe're up against powers we can't fight.": "",
  "At least, until this very moment.": "",
  "At least, not until now.": "",
  "The prosecution moves to call a witness to the stand.\nSomeone who can deny this case's link to the ADDC.": "",
  "The prosecution calls a witness to the stand.\nSomeone who can refute this case's link to the ADDC.": "",
  "The Vice Minister of\nthe Ministry of Health, Kaoru Ichinose.": "",
  "The Vice Minister of the Ministry of Health,\nKaoru Ichinose-san.": "",
  "The ADDC bears most of the responsibilities\ncarried out by the Medical Institute.": "",
  "Most notably, the development of AD-9,\nwhich was announced to the world last year.": "",
  "Most notably the development of AD-9,\nannounced to the world last year.": "",
  "Director Kido has done a fine job overseeing\nits evolution into a matter of national import.": "",
  "Director Kido has done a fine job overseeing its evolution\ninto a matter of national import.": "",
  "Can you tell the Court\nwhat exactly AD-9 is? ": "",
  "Can you tell the Court what exactly AD-9 is? ": "",
  "It is a revolutionary drug meant to be\na complete cure for Alzheimer's disease.": "",
  "Given how pressing the drastic increase in dementia\npatients is, we've placed great faith and hope into AD-9.": "",
  "Given how pressing the drastic increase in dementia patients is,\nwe've placed great faith in AD-9.": "",
  "I have no further questions.": "",
  "The ADDC's irrelevance is clear.": "",
  "Members of the jury. Despite the defense's claims\nthat the ADDC is somehow related to this case...": "",
  "Despite the defense's claims that the ADDC\nis somehow related to this case...": "",
  "The prosecution holds that it is an absurdity to link such a reputable\ninstitution to the horrible murder that took place not long ago.": "",
  "The prosecution holds that such a link is absurd.\nThis grisly murder has no connection to such a reputable institution.": "",
  "You may begin the cross-examination, counsel.": "",
  "You may begin the\ncross-examination, counsel.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Here we go.)</color>": "",
  "You're the Vice Minister of the Ministry of Health,\ncorrect? Pretty high rank.": "",
  "The witness's title was the Vice Minister, correct?\nEven in the Ministry of Health, that's near the top.": "",
  "That is what the title implies, yes.": "",
  "You must have really stood out\nto attain that position.": "",
  "Maybe you did something extra special\nthat got you noticed?": "",
  "Maybe... you did something extra special\nthat got you noticed?": "",
  "I'm not sure how this is relevant\nto the case at hand.": "",
  "Oh come now.\nWhy not indulge him?": "",
  "Oh, come now.\nWhy not indulge him?": "",
  "Think back to 2002.\nThe year the Medical Institute was founded.": "",
  "Think back to 2002. The year that the\nMedical Institute was founded.": "",
  "I hear you spearheaded that whole operation.": "",
  "I hear you spearheaded\nthat whole operation.": "",
  "As a result, many new organizations\ncame into being. The ADDC included.": "",
  "As a result, the ADDC came into being,\nalong with quite a few other organizations.": "",
  "Naturally, many Ministry of Health officials\nwelcomed this move because...": "",
  "Naturally, many Ministry of Health officials\nwelcomed this move. Because...": "",
  "You gave the Ministry more presence in the public mindshare.\nIt's no wonder they thought highly of you, Ichinose-san.": "",
  "Thanks to you, the Ministry had more presence in the public mindshare.\nIt's no wonder they thought highly of you, Ichinose-san.": "",
  "You gave hope to a nation of aspiring doctors and researchers.\nIt's truly incredible how you shot up the ranks.": "",
  "You gave hope to a nation of aspiring doctors and researchers.\nIt's no wonder you shot up the ranks, Ichinose-san.": "",
  "Hm? You have a point there, but...": "",
  "What are you getting at?": "",
  "Hrm? What are you getting at?": "",
  "Um, this is no time\nto be stroking his ego.": "",
  "You made numerous new positions\nfor senior executives to retire into.": "",
  "You opened up positions for executives\nto retire into.": "",
  "Thanks to you, they'd have a stable\nincome well into old age.": "",
  "Thanks to you, they'd have a stable income,\nwell into old age.": "",
  "Is this really the place\nto be discussing such accusations?": "",
  "Now, is this really the place\nto make such accusations?": "",
  "This center, that lab,\nwho-cares-what hospital.": "",
  "This center, that lab,\nany random hospital would do.": "",
  "Consultancy positions sprung up\nfor those facilities left and right.": "",
  "\"Consultancy\" positions sprung up\nfor those facilities left and right.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Wow, I had no idea.": "โห ไม่รู้มาก่อนเลย",
  "What are you getting at?": "คุณจะพูดอะไรกันแน่?"
 }
}
